@hint listApprovalBriefs List approval briefs
@hint createApprovalBrief Create an approval brief (admin)
@hint acknowledgeApprovalBrief Approver acknowledges the brief (idempotent)
@hint markApprovalBriefViewed Mark a brief as viewed (idempotent)
@hint listApprovalDecisions List approval decisions
@hint createApprovalDecision Record an approval decision (admin)
@hint expireApprovalDecision Mark an approval decision expired (idempotent)
@hint revokeApprovalDecision Revoke an approval decision
@hint listApprovalEvidencePacks List approval evidence packs
@hint createApprovalEvidencePack Create an approval evidence pack (admin)
@hint exportApprovalEvidencePack Download a self-contained JSON bundle of the evidence pack
@hint listApproverKnowledgeSnapshots List approver knowledge snapshots (admin)
@hint createApproverKnowledgeSnapshot Create an approver knowledge snapshot (admin)
@hint listConsequenceMaps List consequence maps (admin)
@hint createConsequenceMap Create a consequence map (admin)
@hint verifyConsequenceMap Verify the signature on a consequence map (admin)
@hint listScenarioRuns List scenario runs
@hint createScenarioRun Queue a scenario run (admin)
@hint getScenarioRun Fetch a scenario run
@hint updateScenarioRun Update a scenario run outcome (admin / runner)
@hint softDeleteScenarioRun Soft-delete a scenario run (admin)
@hint generateEvidenceFromRun Create an approval evidence pack from a scenario run (admin)
@hint rerunScenarioRun Replay a scenario run (admin)
@hint listScenarios List scenarios
@hint createScenario Create a scenario (admin)
@hint getScenario Fetch a scenario
@hint updateScenario Update a scenario (admin)
@hint softDeleteScenario Soft-delete a scenario (admin)
@hint listStressTests List stress tests (admin)
@hint createStressTest Create a stress test (admin)
@hint rerunStressTest Execute a stress test (admin)
@hint listStressors List stressor library entries (admin)
@hint createStressor Create a stressor library entry (admin)

@end
